% A goal variable named X_1 must not shadow the slot holding the active
% conjunct's second argument: it did, and the s(U) index condition then
% read r's argument instead of U, losing the combination. The compiler
% reserves the slot names ($X_0, $X_1, ...), which source cannot spell.
:- module(aggregates_goal_shadow, [go/1]).
:- use_module(library(aggregates)).

:- chr_constraint p/1, c/2, r/1, s/1, out/1, ask/1, go/1.

p(W), count((c(W, U), r(X_1), s(U)), N) ==> N > 0 | out(N).

out(N) \ ask(A) <=> A = N.

go(A) <=> p(1), r(7), s(5), c(1, 5), ask(A).
